  "<size=23>Passionate Performance <color=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color></size>": "",
  "Deal Elec damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK. There is a $1 base chance to inflict <link=\"s|104\"><u>[Shock]</u></link> on the main target for 2 turns. If an ally has <link=\"s|190\"><u>[Loyal Listener]</u></link>, deal bonus Elec damage to the main target equal to <color=#FFFC40>$3</color> of that ally's ATK.\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>Let the heartbeat flutter and let the melody tear the earth. Tonight's goal is \"overturning the roof\" and \"electric shock all over the world\"!</color></size></b>": "",
  "Improvised Solo Lv.$1": "",
  "Improvised Solo <color=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color>": "",
  "Grant 1 ally <link=\"s|190\"><u>[Loyal Listener]</u></link>，increase their ATK by $1 of Ayaka's ATK (up to <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> ATK) for $3 turns. Only 1 ally can have <link=\"s|190\"><u>[Loyal Listener]</u></link> at a time.\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>Let's make your debut in front of the loudest cheers, the Queen of Rock and Roll will not let Loyal Listener down!</color></size></b>": "",
  "<size=24>Finale: Range Unleash Lv.$1</size>": "",
  "<size=24>Finale: Range Unleash <color=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color></size>": "",
  "Select 1 ally to immediately use their HIGHLIGHT, increase that HIGHLIGHT damage by <color=#FFFC40>$1</color>. HIGHLIGHT used by this skill will not count towards their HIGHLIGHT cooldown. If the target is a SEES member, then increase their next {{A}} Final DMG Amp by <color=#FFFC40>$2</color>.\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>The wild and unruly girl vocalist is going to perform the finale song of the night, and the atmosphere has already reached its climax!</color></size></b>": "",
  "[HIGHLIGHT]: Increase all allies' DMG Bonus by <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> for 4 actions. Restore $2 HIGHLIGHT Energy after each ally's action, up to $3. \\n[ONE MORE]: Deal Elec damage to 1 foe. \\nMelee Attack: Uses a melee weapon to deal light Phys damage to 1 foe. \\nGun Attack: Deal light Gun damage to 1 foe. Can fire until out of ammo.": "",
  "When an ally uses HIGHLIGHT/{{A}}, immediately increase their ATK by <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> for 1 turn; Increase this effect by 1.5x if they are the Loyal Listener.": "",
  "When an ally uses HIGHLIGHT/{{A}}, immediately increase their ATK by <color=#0169ca>$1</color> for 1 turn; Increase this effect by 1.5x if they are the Loyal Listener.": "",
  "After an ally uses HIGHLIGHT/{{C}}, you immediately restore <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> ATK + <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> HP to the lowest HP% ally.": "",
  "After an ally uses HIGHLIGHT/{{C}}, you immediately restore <color=#0169ca>$1</color> ATK + <color=#0169ca>$2</color> HP to the lowest HP% ally.": "",
  "Increase [Loyal Listener]'s ATK by <color=#FFFC40>$1</color>. If the target is an Elec character, additionally increase their DMG Bonus by <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> and Crit DMG by <color=#FFFC40>$3</color>.": "",
  "Increase [Loyal Listener]'s ATK by <color=#0169ca>$1</color>. If the target is an Elec character, additionally increase their DMG Bonus by <color=#0169ca>$2</color> and Crit DMG by <color=#0169ca>$3</color>.": "",
  "When activating [Finale: Range Unleash], immediately increase target's HIGHLIGHT/{{A}} Total DMG Amp by <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> + Ayaka's Awareness level * $2 and ATK by <color=#FFFC40>$3</color> + Ayaka's Awareness level * $4. Lasts for $5 turns.": "",
  "When activating [Finale: Range Unleash], immediately increase target's HIGHLIGHT/{{A}} Total DMG Amp by <color=#0169ca>$1</color> + Ayaka's Awareness level * $2 and ATK by <color=#0169ca>$3</color> + Ayaka's Awareness level * $4. Lasts for $5 turns.": "",
  "Loyal Listener": "",
  "<color=#66ccff>[Loyal Listener]</color>": "",
  "Increase ATK based on {{A}}'s ATK.": "",
  "♪ My Light ♪": "",
  "At the start of battle, [Finale: Range Unleash] has a 1 turn cooldown. Permanently increase own ATK by $1 after using [Finale: Range Unleash], up to 2 stacks. Afterwards permanently increase the cooldown for [Finale: Range Unleash] by 1 turn, up to 3 turns.": "",
  "♪ Greet My Dawn Star ♪": "",
  "At the start of battle, select 1 ally to become the <link=\"s|190\"><u>[Loyal Listener]</u></link>, prioritizing the highest ATK Assassin or Sweeper ally. <link=\"s|190\"><u>[Loyal Listener]</u></link> gains additional effect: Increase Crit Rate by $1.": "",
  "♪ Lonely Shimmers ♪": "",
  "♪ Mr. Light ♪": "",
  "When using [Finale: Range Unleash], immediately increase that ally's damage by $1 for $2 turns.": "",
  "♪ Painted My Scenes ♪": "",
  "♪ Change My Life ♪": "",
  "HIGHLIGHT Enhanced: Increase DMG Bonus duration to 6 ally actions. Increase HIGHLIGHT Energy restore cap to $1 and decrease all other allies' HIGHLIGHT cooldown by 1 turn.": "",
  "♪ My Mr. Right ♪": "",
  "At the start of battle, [Finale: Range Unleash] can be used immediately. Cooldown time is permanently decreased to 1 turn and won't increase. Every time [Finale: Range Unleash] is used, increase the party's damage by $1. Stacks up to $2 times.": "",
  "Deal Elec damage to <color=#FFFF00>all</color> foes equal to $1 of ATK. There is a $2 base chance to inflict [Shock] on the main target for 2 turns. If an ally has [Loyal Listener], deal bonus Elec damage to the main target equal to $3 of that ally's ATK.": "",
  "Deal Elec damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK. There is a $2 base chance to inflict <link=\"s|104\"><u>[Shock]</u></link> on the main target for 2 turns. If an ally has <link=\"s|190\"><u>[Loyal Listener]</u></link>, deal bonus Elec damage to the main target equal to <color=#FFFC40>$3</color> of that ally's ATK.": "",
  "Grant <color=#FFFF00>1</color> ally [Loyal Listener]，increase their ATK by $1 of Ayaka's ATK (up to $2 ATK) for $3 turns. Only 1 ally can have [Loyal Listener] at a time.": "",
  "Grant 1 ally <link=\"s|190\"><u>[Loyal Listener]</u></link>，increase their ATK by $1 of Ayaka's ATK (up to <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> ATK) for $3 turns. Only 1 ally can have <link=\"s|190\"><u>[Loyal Listener]</u></link> at a time.": "",
