  "F<color=#000000>i</color>nale: Range Unleash": "",
  "r:\"Immediately activate the selected ally's Highlight and increase its damage by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color>\\. This skill does not affect the target's Highlight cooldown time, even if it activates a Highlight\\.\\nIf the selected character has a Theurgy, the next time they activate a Theurgy, increase final damage amplification by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color>\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>Revs up the crowd with an exciting guitar solo, instantly activating an ally's Highlight\\.</color></size></b>\"": "",
  "r:\"^Deal\\\\s+Electric\\\\s+damage\\\\s+to\\\\s+all\\\\s+foes\\\\s+equal\\\\s+to\\\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\\\d+\\\\.?\\\\d*)%</color>\\\\s+of\\\\s+Attack\\\\.\\\\s+(\\\\d+)%\\\\s+chance\\\\s+to\\\\s+inflict\\\\s+<link\\=\"s\\\\|(\\\\d+)\"><u>Shock</u></link>\\\\s+on\\\\s+the\\\\s+main\\\\s+target\\\\s+for\\\\s+(\\\\d+)\\\\s+turns\\\\.\\\\nIf\\\\s+an\\\\s+ally\\\\s+has\\\\s+<link\\=\"s\\\\|(\\\\d+)\"><u>Costar</u></link>,\\\\s+deal\\\\s+bonus\\\\s+Electric\\\\s+damage\\\\s+to\\\\s+the\\\\s+main\\\\s+target\\\\s+equal\\\\s+to\\\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\\\d+\\\\.?\\\\d*)%</color>\\\\s+of\\\\s+that\\\\s+ally's\\\\s+Attack\\\\s+\\\\((\\\\d+)\\\\s+hit\\\\)\\\\.\\\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>An\\\\s+explosive\\\\s+chord\\\\s+sends\\\\s+sound\\\\s+waves\\\\s+rippling\\\\s+through\\\\s+the\\\\s+air,\\\\s+dealing\\\\s+Electric\\\\s+damage\\\\s+to\\\\s+an\\\\s+enemy\\\\.</color></size></b>$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Grant\\\\s+<link\\=\"s\\\\|(\\\\d+)\"><u>Costar</u></link>\\\\s+to\\\\s+(\\\\d+)\\\\s+ally,\\\\s+and\\\\s+increase\\\\s+their\\\\s+Attack\\\\s+by\\\\s+(\\\\d+\\\\.?\\\\d*)%\\\\s+of\\\\s+Ayaka's\\\\s+Attack\\\\s+\\\\(up\\\\s+to\\\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\\\d+)</color>\\\\)\\\\s+for\\\\s+(\\\\d+)\\\\s+turns\\\\.\\\\nOnly\\\\s+(\\\\d+)\\\\s+ally\\\\s+can\\\\s+be\\\\s+a\\\\s+Costar\\\\s+at\\\\s+a\\\\s+time\\\\.\\\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>Two\\\\s+stars\\\\s+take\\\\s+the\\\\s+stage\\\\s+and\\\\s+perform\\\\s+in\\\\s+perfect\\\\s+unison,\\\\s+increasing\\\\s+allies'\\\\s+Attack\\\\.</color></size></b>$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Highlight：For\\\\s+(\\d+)\\\\s+ally\\\\s+actions,\\\\s+increase\\\\s+the\\\\s+party's\\\\s+damage\\\\s+by\\\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+\\.?\\d*)%</color>\\\\.\\\\s*While\\\\s+active,\\\\s+fill\\\\s+the\\\\s+Highlight\\\\s+gauge\\\\s+by\\\\s+(\\d+)%\\\\s+after\\\\s+an\\\\s+ally\\\\s+acts\\\\s+\\\\(up\\\\s+to\\\\s+(\\d+)%\\\\)\\\\.\\\\s*1\\\\s+MORE：Deal\\\\s+Electric\\\\s+damage\\\\s+to\\\\s+(\\d+)\\\\s+foe\\\\.\\\\s*Melee\\\\s+Attack：Deal\\\\s+Physical\\\\s+damage\\\\s+to\\\\s+(\\d+)\\\\s+foe\\\\.\\\\s*Ranged\\\\s+Attack：Deal\\\\s+Gun\\\\s+damage\\\\s+to\\\\s+(\\d+)\\\\s+foe\\\\.\\\\s*Can\\\\s+fire\\\\s+until\\\\s+out\\\\s+of\\\\s+ammo\\\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"When an ally uses a Highlight or Theurgy, increase target's Attack by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> for (\\d+) turn\\.\\nWhen the target has <link\\=\"s\\|(\\d+)\"><u>Costar</u></link>, increase effect by ([\\d\\.]+) times\\.\"": "",
  "r:\"After an ally uses a Highlight or Theurgy, the ally with the lowest HP recovers HP equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> of Ayaka's Attack \\+ <color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+)</color>\\.\"": "",
  "When using Catchy Hook, increase Ayaka's Attack by 20% (up to 40%) for that battle.\\nCatchy Hook has a cooldown time of 1 turn before it can be used. Increase the cooldown time each time Catchy Hook is used (up to 3 turns).": "",
  "At the start of battle, grant <link\\=\"s|190\"><u>Costar</u></link> to the ally with the highest Attack for 3 turns (prioritizing Assassins and Sweepers).\\nIncrease that ally's critical rate by 15%.": "",
  "When using Catchy Hook, increase targeted ally's damage by 30% for 2 turns.": "",
  "When using Catchy Hook, increase targeted ally's damage by 30% for 1 turn.": "",
  "Increase the skill levels of Distortion and Catchy Hook by 3.": "",
  "Highlight Enhanced: Increase effect duration to 6 ally actions.\\nFill the Highlight gauge to 60%, and decrease Highlight activation cooldown for all other allies by 1 turn.": "",
